      "body": "Fixes #41317.\n\nDeepSeek reference encoders keep string values verbatim; `(.*?)$` does not strip. Set `strip_string_param_value=False` to match, like DeepSeekV41Detector already does.\n\nSigned-off-by: ding <2756823972@qq.com>\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #38027018778](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38027018778)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #38027018559](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38027018559)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #38027018685](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38027018685)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
